// Spelling to phoneme rules for Kazakh

// Letters
// The names of the spelling textbook «Емле және тыныс белгілері» (Pavlodar
// 2021): a vowel is named by its own sound, a consonant with ы after it (бы,
// ды ...), к and г with і (кі, гі), л, р, ң with ы before them (ыл, ыр, ың);
// в, ф, ц, ч, щ, met only in borrowed words, have their Russian names (ве, эф,
// це, че, ща). The names of the vowels are given with _ so that they are
// used only in spelling.
