// Punctuation marks and symbols. The names of the marks are those of the
// spelling textbook «Емле және тыныс белгілері» (Pavlodar 2021); the others
// those of the Kazakh Wikipedia (Тыныс белгілері). Those with _ are named only
// when they are read out (--punct) or spelled; those without _ are also said
// in a text, as they were before (in English).
_.	nu#kt'e	// нүкте
